  "notes": {
    "cnt_web": "**Web Host \u2014 ASP.NET Core 10**\n\nTranslates wire **operations** (polymorphic JSON) into engine calls, owns the **SignalR** hub (op stream \u002B delta broadcast) and the REST endpoints (load \u00B7 snapshot \u00B7 layout \u00B7 views). The **only** place LLM access lives.\n\n#squad: Core",
    "cnt_client": "**Web Client \u2014 React 19 \u002B Vite**\n\nRenders the active view on an \u0060@xyflow/react\u0060 canvas, captures gestures as operations, and patches its local graph from deltas. **Holds no authoritative model state** \u2014 a refresh re-fetches the snapshot.\n\n#squad: Frontend",
    "mod_stemmaengine": "**StemmaEngine \u2014 workspace facade**\n\nLoads the folder as a Roslyn \u0060MSBuildWorkspace\u0060, holds the canonical model in memory, applies operations as targeted \u0060DocumentEditor\u0060 rewrites, and emits deltas.\n\n\u003E Pure: depends only on Roslyn \u002B \u0060Stemma.Model\u0060. No web / LLM references (ADR-0008).",
    "mod_dslwriter": "**DslWriter \u2014 DocumentEditor**\n\nEvery model edit is a *targeted node replacement* that preserves trivia byte-for-byte.\n\n\u26A0\uFE0F Never \u0060NormalizeWhitespace()\u0060. Never rebuild a file by string concatenation. The git diff must contain **only** the intended change.",
    "mod_layoutcache": "**Sidecar Cache \u2014 lib/layout.ts**\n\nOne shared in-memory cache for all presentation state (positions, styles, notes, custom props, shapes).\n\n\u003E Primed **once** per workspace, then authoritative; debounce-flushed to \u0060stemma.layout.json\u0060. Re-fetching mid-session clobbers unflushed edits.",
    "sys_git": "**Git Working Tree \u2014 the database**\n\nThere is no SQLite, no Postgres, no embedded store. The model **is** \u0060Architecture/Architecture.cs\u0060 \u002B \u0060Views/*.cs\u0060; presentation is \u0060stemma.layout.json\u0060. History, branching, and review are Git\u0027s job.",
    "mod_llmservice": "**LLM Service**\n\nThe single home of LLM access. Proposes model edits the agent applies through the engine as ordinary operations. Kept out of the engine to preserve purity.\n\n#squad: Core #domain: AI",
    "mod_fidelity": "**Round-trip Fidelity Suite**\n\nThe core gate: for every operation on a file \u0060F\u0060, \u0060F\u0027\u0060 differs **only** in the targeted region. xUnit \u002B FluentAssertions; minimal / realistic / pathological fixtures per operation.\n\n#squad: QA"
  },
  "customProps": {
    "cnt_web": {
      "framework": "ASP.NET Core 10",
      "transport": "REST \u002B SignalR",
      "squad": "Core"
    },
    "cnt_client": {
      "framework": "React 19 \u002B Vite",
      "canvas": "@xyflow/react"
    },
    "mod_stemmaengine": {
      "purity": "Roslyn \u002B Model only"
    },
    "mod_dslwriter": {
      "rule": "DocumentEditor only"
    },
    "mod_layoutcache": {
      "rule": "prime once, never re-fetch"
    }
  },
  "annotations": {}
}